# Raw source photos and video straight off the phone (~130MB).
#
# ⚠ THESE ARE STILL TRACKED. This rule only stops NEW files being added here;
#   it does not untrack what is already committed.
#
# BLOCKS PUSHING TO GITHUB: Images/video_2026-08-08_15-27-21.mp4 is 111MB and
# GitHub hard-rejects any file over 100MB. Any push will be refused until that
# blob is out of history — which needs either `git rm -r --cached Images` plus
# a history rewrite, or Git LFS. Left alone deliberately, pending a decision.
#
# The site itself does not need this folder; the files it serves are committed
# under apps/bfmutare/public/ (featured/, deliveries/, partnership/, video/).
Images/

# large local research dumps
notes/composio.txt

